:: reebok-6100 {"position": "1825,375", "size": "100,100"}
<div class="passage-content">
The Reebok 6100 was used in 2005-07, and has same boxy style as older CCM/Koho jerseys. Generally not faked, but it is best to ask in the <a href="https://reddit.com/r/hockeyjerseys/about/sticky">r/hockeyjerseys monthly legit check thread</a> or the <a href="https://discord.com/invite/hockeyjerseys">Hockey Jerseys Discord</a>. They are *extremely* rare, especially in size 48.
</div>

